    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>From the lens formula,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>v</mi></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>u</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>f</mi></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>&nbsp;now, if we plot a graph between&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0160_57317e6c29ec.png\" style=\"width: 186px; height: 188px;\" /></p><p>When&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mo>&#8734;</mo><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8734;</mo></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi></math></p><p>and for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>&#160;</mo></math>is&nbsp;a reference line, therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><menclose notation=\"right\"><mfrac><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>v</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>d</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow></mfrac></menclose><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>f</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>The equation of tangent of the curve at the origin,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi></math></p>"
  }
